        "text": "The study was conducted three-fold, assigning three separate tasks to ChatGPT. The first M a n u s c r i p t In sum, this study employs a zero-shot performance evaluation approach, mimicking how teachers might interact with generative AI in their day-to-day activities without specific fine-tuning. This approach aligns with practical implementations and offers insights into the model's adaptability. However, the effectiveness of generative AI, as demonstrated in the study, is contingent upon the availability of ample training data and illustrative examples, the lack of which points out challenges in replicating the novelty and insightfulness of human-generated feedback. Despite illustrating ChatGPT's performance of zero-shot prompting, the study still calls for development and fine-tuning required for AI models in the context of teacher coaching and professional development.",
